{"page":110,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:14","surah":5,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّا نَصَـٰرَىٰٓ أَخَذْنَا مِيثَـٰقَهُمْ فَنَسُوا۟ حَظًّا مِّمَّا ذُكِّرُوا۟ بِهِۦ فَأَغْرَيْنَا بَيْنَهُمُ ٱلْعَدَاوَةَ وَٱلْبَغْضَآءَ إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ وَسَوْفَ يُنَبِّئُهُمُ ٱللَّهُ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَصْنَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We also took a pledge from those who say, ‘We are Christians,’ but they too forgot some of what they were told to remember, so We stirred up enmity and hatred among them until the Day of Resurrection, when God will tell them what they have done.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"And from","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَصَـٰرَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"(are) Christians","transliteration":"naṣārā","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَخَذْنَا","en_gloss":"We took","transliteration":"akhadhnā","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِيثَـٰقَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their covenant","transliteration":"mīthāqahum","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَنَسُوا۟","en_gloss":"but they forgot","transliteration":"fanasū","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حَظًّۭا","en_gloss":"a part","transliteration":"ḥaẓẓan","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّمَّا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ذُكِّرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were reminded","transliteration":"dhukkirū","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"of [it]","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَأَغْرَيْنَا","en_gloss":"So We aroused","transliteration":"fa-aghraynā","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمُ","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahumu","verse_key":"5:14"},{"pos"