ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"يَهْدِى بِهِ ٱللَّهُ مَنِ ٱتَّبَعَ رِضْوَٰنَهُۥ سُبُلَ ٱلسَّلَـٰمِ وَيُخْرِجُهُم مِّنَ ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ إِلَى ٱلنُّورِ بِإِذْنِهِۦ وَيَهْدِيهِمْ إِلَىٰ صِرَٰطٍ مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"with which God guides to the ways of peace those who follow what pleases Him, bringing them from darkness out into light, by His will, and guiding them to a straight path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَهْدِى","en_gloss":"Guides","transliteration":"yahdī","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِهِ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَنِ","en_gloss":"(those) who","transliteration":"mani","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱتَّبَعَ","en_gloss":"seek","transliteration":"ittabaʿa","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رِضْوَٰنَهُۥ","en_gloss":"His pleasure","transliteration":"riḍ'wānahu","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سُبُلَ","en_gloss":"(to the) ways","transliteration":"subula","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلسَّلَـٰمِ","en_gloss":"(of) the peace","transliteration":"l-salāmi","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيُخْرِجُهُم","en_gloss":"and brings them out","transliteration":"wayukh'rijuhum","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the darknessess","transliteration":"l-ẓulumāti","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلنُّورِ","en_gloss":"the light","transliteration":"l-nūri","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِإِذْنِهِۦ","en_gloss":"by His permission","transliteration":"bi-idh'nihi","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَيَهْدِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"and guides them","transliteration":"wayahdīhim","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":17,"ar":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) straight","transliteration":"mus'taqīmin","verse_key":"5:16"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:16"}]},{"verse_key":"5:17","surah":5,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"لَّقَدْ كَفَرَ ٱلَّذِينَ قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ هُوَ ٱلْمَسِيحُ ٱبْنُ مَرْيَمَ ۚ قُلْ فَمَن يَمْلِكُ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ شَيْـًٔا إِنْ أَرَادَ أَن يُهْلِكَ ٱلْمَسِيحَ ٱبْنَ مَرْيَمَ وَأُمَّهُۥ وَمَن فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ جَمِيعًا ۗ وَلِلَّهِ مُلْكُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا ۚ يَخْلُقُ مَا يَشَآءُ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who say, ‘God is the Messiah, the son of Mary,’ are defying the truth. Say, ‘If it had been God’s will, could anyone have prevented Him from destroying the Messiah, son of Mary, together with his mother and everyone else on earth? Control of the heavens and earth and all that is between them belongs to God: He creates whatever He will. God has power over everything.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَّقَدْ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"5:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرَ","en_gloss":"disbelieved ","transliteration":"kafara","verse_key":"5:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"5:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"5:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"5:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"5:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"5:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمَسِيحُ","en_gloss":"(is) the Messiah","transliteration":"l-masīḥu","verse_key":"5:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱبْنُ","en_gloss":"son","transliteration":"ub'nu","verse_key":"5:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَرْيَمَ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Maryam","transliteration":"maryama","verse_key":"5:17"},{"pos